OL,3,ARussian strikes and approaching winter
OL,4,Aforce some in Kyiv to pack bags and
OL,5,Aflee
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs Russia's attacks on Ukraine's cities
OL,8,Fintensify and autumn's cooler
OL,9,Ftemperatures hint at another tough
OL,10,Fwinter to come, Ukrainians are
OL,11,Fwrestling with how to meet the twin
OL,12,Fchallenges ahead: Russian drone and
OL,13,Fmissile strikes and the biting cold.
OL,15,F"It was a very difficult winter last
OL,16,Fyear in Kyiv," says mother of two
OL,17,FMariia Shostak, who is now packing her
OL,18,Fbags and leaving her small flat.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
