OL,3,ARussian strikes and approaching winter
OL,4,Aforce some in Kyiv to pack bags and
OL,5,Aflee
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith prolonged periods of sub-zero
OL,8,Ftemperatures and frequent power cuts
OL,9,Fbrought about by Russia's attack on the
OL,10,Fcountry's power grid, last winter was
OL,11,Fone of the hardest so far.
OL,13,F"There were some days and weeks that
OL,14,Fwere unbearable. I started thinking I'm
OL,15,Fnot going through another winter like
OL,16,Fthis."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
